{"title": "Shadow Portal", "pageid": 34798, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shadow_Portal", "categories": ["Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the portal to the Shadowfell summoned by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/25px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/38px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/50px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Halsin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/25px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\">Halsin</a>, see <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Crossing\" title=\"Shadow Crossing\">Shadow Crossing</a>.</div>      <aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Shadow_Portal.PNG\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Shadow Portal.PNG\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Shadow_Portal.PNG/300px-Shadow_Portal.PNG.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Shadow_Portal.PNG/300px-Shadow_Portal.PNG.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Shadow_Portal.PNG/599px-Shadow_Portal.PNG.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Shadow Portal.PNG\" width=\"270\" height=\"286\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-panel-scroll-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"pi-section-navigation\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pi-section-tab pi-item-spacing pi-section-active\" data-ref=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pi-section-label\">Balanced</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"pi-section-contents\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"pi-section-content pi-section-active\" data-ref=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Balanced Difficulty Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hp\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">HP</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">142</div>\n</div></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section></aside>\n<b>Shadow Portal</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Environmental_object\" title=\"Environmental object\">environmental object</a> encountered in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a>. <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oliver\" title=\"Oliver\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Oliver.png/25px-Portrait_Oliver.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Oliver.png/38px-Portrait_Oliver.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Oliver.png/50px-Portrait_Oliver.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Oliver\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Oliver.png/25px-Portrait_Oliver.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Oliver.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oliver\" title=\"Oliver\">Oliver</a> creates this portal when running away from the party during <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lift_the_Shadow_Curse\" title=\"Lift the Shadow Curse\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lift the Shadow Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lift_the_Shadow_Curse\" title=\"Lift the Shadow Curse\">Lift the Shadow Curse</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Oliver runs when confronted about his identity, creating and traveling through the Shadow Portal. Following him through the portal teleports the party to <a href=\"/wiki/Reithwin_Town\" title=\"Reithwin Town\">Reithwin Town</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-152&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-26</span>.\n</p><p>The portal can be destroyed. Doing so has no tangible effect, other than increasing the party's step counter to reach Oliver.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_Quests\">Related Quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lift_the_Shadow_Curse\" title=\"Lift the Shadow Curse\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lift the Shadow Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lift_the_Shadow_Curse\" title=\"Lift the Shadow Curse\">Lift the Shadow Curse</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714232731\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.095 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.100 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3920/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36867/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15404/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1457/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1039396/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   93.146      1 -total\n 81.65%   76.057      1 Template:Infobox_creature\n 50.57%   47.101      1 Template:Infobox_creature/internal\n 23.46%   21.852      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 14.85%   13.829      4 Template:Icon_link\n 14.32%   13.339      4 Template:Icon_text\n 12.65%   11.780      2 Template:CharLink\n 12.50%   11.647     18 Template:Trim\n 11.60%   10.808      1 Template:Template_style\n 10.73%    9.990      1 Template:Hatnote\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34798-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714232731 and revision id 401500. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}